# Review Checklist

Use before opening or merging a PR.

## Automated gates

```bash
npm run lint
npx tsc --noEmit
npm run build
```

## Security

- [ ] No `.env` or secrets in `git diff --staged`
- [ ] No service role key in client or `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` vars
- [ ] Server Actions that touch data verify user via `getUser()`
- [ ] New/changed tables have RLS and policies tested mentally against `auth.uid()`
- [ ] User-facing errors do not leak internal details

## Code quality

- [ ] No `any`
- [ ] Changes match existing naming and folder layout
- [ ] No unrelated refactors bundled in the same PR
- [ ] OAuth/public routes listed in `proxy.ts` if added

## Database

- [ ] Migration file + `schema.sql` stay in sync
- [ ] CHECK constraints match Zod rules (e.g. description length, categories)

## Git / GitHub

- [ ] Branch off `main`; not pushing directly to `main`
- [ ] Commit message describes why
- [ ] Dependabot major bumps: confirm CI (TS 7 / ESLint 10 were previously rejected)

## Manual (when relevant)

- [ ] Supabase Dashboard: redirect URLs, Google provider, email confirm setting
- [ ] New env vars documented in README or `.env.example` if added
